The provider is test infrastructure and is not linked into the real-NIC plugin.

Shared transport extraction
---------------------------
Device metadata, topology derivation, RC queue-pair setup, registration,
posting/completion primitives and window arithmetic use transport-core 0.1.0.
The ext-net API, CTS protocol, registration policy and progress scheduling remain
owned by net-sircl. Hardware measurements for the shared-core source a4de4dd5 are summarized in
../docs/measurements.md, with scope and conditions. They are not performance guarantees.

